  prayer: {
    zh: '耶和华啊，你察看隐秘的事，也看重合宜与分寸。求你教我谦卑，不急着为自己抢位置，而是甘心站在较低的地方，把抬举交给你。求你使我的舌头有智慧——知道该说什么，也知道在什么时候、用什么方式说；让我的话如金苹果在银网子里，如给口渴之人的凉水。当我面对伤害我的人，求你给我力量以善待代替报复，把伸冤交在你手中。也求你在我生命的城墙有破口的地方，帮助我一块一块地重建自制，好使我所有的恩赐都有保护。奉主的名，阿们。',
    en: 'LORD, you search out hidden things and you value what is fitting and well-proportioned. Teach me humility, not to rush and grab a place for myself but to gladly take the lower place and leave the lifting up to you. Give my tongue wisdom — to know what to say, and when and how to say it; let my words be like apples of gold in settings of silver, like cold water to a thirsty soul. When I face those who hurt me, give me strength to replace revenge with kindness and to leave vindication in your hands. And where the wall of my life is breached, help me rebuild self-control one stone at a time, so that all you’ve given me is guarded. In Jesus’ name, Amen.',
  },

